{"unit_id":"ymck-x__dsh-session-continuity#card-zh","repo":"ymck-x/dsh-session-continuity","commit":"f22b8f98693d9d252a863025625f1ef3cbcfa318","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-continuity 是一个 DSH 会话接续插件，在新会话的第一个模型步骤添加一条轻量背景消息。它会优先查找工作区中的交接文档；没有文档时尝试复用上个会话的压缩摘要，再退回用户和助手的最后消息。插件按工作区选择前一主会话，过滤子代理，并依据当前用户语言生成中文或英文指针。摘要和末尾内容受字节预算限制，标题也会截短。适合经常开启新会话、希望带回必要工作背景的 DSH 用户；不需要 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:115-138","index.js:145-184","index.js:199-230"]}
{"unit_id":"ymck-x__dsh-session-continuity#card-en","repo":"ymck-x/dsh-session-continuity","commit":"f22b8f98693d9d252a863025625f1ef3cbcfa318","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-continuity adds a short pointer at the first step of a new DSH session. It links to a workspace handoff file, or falls back to the prior session’s summary and latest messages. It limits carried text and supports Chinese or English. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:115-138","index.js:145-184","index.js:199-230"]}
