{"unit_id":"ymck-x__dsh-session-continuity#feature-1","repo":"ymck-x/dsh-session-continuity","commit":"f22b8f98693d9d252a863025625f1ef3cbcfa318","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-continuity 的功能「新会话接续指针」：在新会话的第一个模型步骤添加上个会话的标题、日期和短 ID，并以带来源标记的消息注入。仅在第一轮第一步执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:115-138","index.js:417-424"]}
