{"unit_id":"ymck-x__dsh-session-continuity#caveat-1","repo":"ymck-x/dsh-session-continuity","commit":"f22b8f98693d9d252a863025625f1ef3cbcfa318","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-continuity 使用前须知：没有交接文档时，可能把前一会话的摘要或最后消息片段带入新会话上下文；可用 summaryBytes 或 tailBytes 设为 0 禁用相应内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:199-230","index.js:433-455"]}
